<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,200;6..72,300;6..72,400&family=Red+Hat+Text:wght@400;500;700&display=swap"> {%- assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}{%- assign words = product.title | split: ' ' -%}{%- assign color_name = '' -%}{%- for w in words offset: 2 -%}{%- assign color_name = color_name | append: w | append: ' ' -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- assign color_name = color_name | strip -%}{%- if color_name == blank -%}{%- assign color_name = product.title -%}{%- endif -%}{%- assign family = nil -%}{%- assign fam_pref = 'les-syenna,cabas-riviera,le-solen,le-nomad,la-milo,pochette-capri' | split: ',' -%}{%- for fh in fam_pref -%}{%- for c in product.collections -%}{%- if c.handle == fh -%}{%- assign family = c -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- if family -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- if family == nil -%}{%- for c in product.collections -%}{%- if c.handle != 'all' and c.handle != 'frontpage' and c.products_count > 1 -%}{%- if family == nil or c.products_count < family.products_count -%}{%- assign family = c -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- endif -%}{%- assign reco = section.settings.reco_collection -%}{%- if reco == blank -%}{%- assign reco = product.collections.first -%}{%- endif -%}{%- assign days = section.settings.delivery_days | times: 86400 -%}{%- assign ts = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: days -%}{%- assign dnum = ts | date: '%w' | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign mnum = ts | date: '%m' | minus: 1 -%}{%- assign day_names = 'dimanche,lundi,mardi,mercredi,jeudi,vendredi,samedi' | split: ',' -%}{%- assign month_names = 'janvier,février,mars,avril,mai,juin,juillet,août,septembre,octobre,novembre,décembre' | split: ',' -%}{%- assign day_of_month = ts | date: '%-d' -%} <div class="mp"><div class="mp__grid"><div class="mp__media"><div class="mp__slider"><div class="mp__track" data-track> {%- for media in product.media -%} {%- if media.media_type == 'image' -%} <div class="mp__slide"><img src="{{ media | image_url: width: 1400 }}" alt="{{ media.alt | escape }}" width="{{ media.width }}" height="{{ media.height }}" {% unless forloop.first %}loading="lazy"{% endunless %}></div> {%- endif -%} {%- else -%} <div class="mp__slide">{{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div> {%- endfor -%} </div> {%- if product.media.size > 1 -%} <button type="button" class="mp__arrow mp__arrow--prev" data-prev aria-label="Image précédente"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M19 12H5M11 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg></button><button type="button" class="mp__arrow mp__arrow--next" data-next aria-label="Image suivante"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button> {%- endif -%} </div> {%- if product.media.size > 1 -%} <div class="mp__thumbs"> {%- for media in product.media -%} {%- if media.media_type == 'image' -%} <button type="button" class="mp__thumb{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" data-thumb="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-label="Voir l’image {{ forloop.index }}"><img src="{{ media | image_url: width: 200 }}" alt="" width="80" height="96" loading="lazy"></button> {%- endif -%} {%- endfor -%} </div> {%- endif -%} </div><div class="mp__info"><h1 class="mp__title">{{ product.title }}</h1> {%- for block in section.blocks -%} {%- if block.type == '@app' -%}<div class="mp__app">{% render block %}</div>{%- endif -%} {%- endfor -%} <div class="mp__price">{{ current_variant.price | money }}{%- if current_variant.compare_at_price > current_variant.price -%} <s>{{ current_variant.compare_at_price | money }}</s>{%- endif -%}</div>{% render 'bundle-offer', product: product, teaser: true %} {%- if family and family.products_count > 1 -%} <div class="mp__colors"><p class="mp__color-label">Couleur: {{ color_name | upcase }}</p><div class="mp__swatches"> {%- for p in family.products limit: 12 -%} <a href="{{ p.url }}" class="mp__swatch{% if p.id == product.id %} is-current{% endif %}{% unless p.available %} is-soldout{% endunless %}" title="{{ p.title | escape }}"><img src="{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 120 }}" alt="{{ p.title | escape }}" width="26" height="26" loading="lazy"></a> {%- endfor -%} </div></div> {%- endif -%} {%- form 'product', product, class: 'mp__form' -%} <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ current_variant.id }}"> {%- unless product.has_only_default_variant -%} <select class="mp__variant" data-variant-select onchange="this.form.id.value=this.value"> {%- for v in product.variants -%}<option value="{{ v.id }}"{% if v.id == current_variant.id %} selected{% endif %}{% unless v.available %} disabled{% endunless %}>{{ v.title }}</option>{%- endfor -%} </select> {%- endunless -%} <div class="mp__buy"><div class="mp__qty"><button type="button" aria-label="Diminuer la quantité" data-qty="-1">−</button><input type="number" name="quantity" value="1" min="1" aria-label="Quantité"><button type="button" aria-label="Augmenter la quantité" data-qty="1">+</button></div><button type="submit" name="add" class="mp__add"{% unless current_variant.available %} disabled{% endunless %}>{% if current_variant.available %}Ajouter au panier{% else %}Épuisé{% endif %}</button></div> {%- endform -%} {% render 'bundle-offer', product: product %} <p class="mp__stock{% if current_variant.available %} is-in{% endif %}"><span></span>{% if current_variant.available %}En stock, prêt à être expédié{% else %}En rupture de stock{% endif %}</p><p class="mp__delivery">Achetez aujourd'hui, livré le <strong>{{ day_names[dnum] }} {{ day_of_month }} {{ month_names[mnum] }}</strong></p><ul class="mp__trust"><li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="1.5"/><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg>{{ section.settings.trust_1 }}</li><li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M9 14L4 9l5-5"/><path d="M4 9h11a5 5 0 0 1 0 10h-3"/></svg>{{ section.settings.trust_2 }}</li><li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 20s-7-4.4-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 10c0 5.6-7 10-7 10z"/></svg>{{ section.settings.trust_3 }}</li></ul> {%- if section.settings.short_text != blank -%}<p class="mp__short">{{ section.settings.short_text }}</p>{%- endif -%} <details class="mp__acc"><summary><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M4 12h16M14 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Description</span><svg class="mp__chev" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="mp__acc-body">{{ product.description }}</div></details></div></div><div class="mp__features"><div><h2>{{ section.settings.f1_title }}</h2>{{ section.settings.f1_text }}</div><div><h2>{{ section.settings.f2_title }}</h2>{{ section.settings.f2_text }}</div><div><h2>{{ section.settings.f3_title }}</h2>{{ section.settings.f3_text }}</div></div> {%- if reco != blank -%} <div class="mp__reco"><h2>{{ section.settings.reco_title }}</h2><div class="mp__reco-grid"> {%- assign shown = 0 -%} {%- for p in reco.products -%} {%- if p.id != product.id and shown < 4 -%} {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%} <a href="{{ p.url }}" class="mp__reco-card"><img src="{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="{{ p.title | escape }}" width="350" height="440" loading="lazy"><span>{{ p.title }}</span><span>{{ p.price | money }}</span></a> {%- endif -%} {%- endfor -%} </div></div> {%- endif -%} </div><style> .mp{--mp-serif:"Newsreader",Georgia,serif;--mp-sans:"Red Hat Text",var(--font-body),sans-serif;font-family:var(--mp-sans);color:#000;letter-spacing:normal;background:#fff;} .mp__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0;align-items:start;} .mp__media{min-width:0;} .mp__slider{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:0 0 18px 0;} .mp__track{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scrollbar-width:none;} .mp__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;} .mp__slide{flex:0 0 100%;scroll-snap-align:start;background:#f2f2f2;} .mp__slide img,.mp__slide svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;} .mp__arrow{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);background:none;border:0;padding:12px;cursor:pointer;color:#000;} .mp__arrow--prev{left:12px;}.mp__arrow--next{right:12px;} .mp__thumbs{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:12px 56px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;} .mp__thumb{flex:none;border:2px solid transparent;padding:0;background:none;cursor:pointer;border-radius:2px;} .mp__thumb.is-active{border-color:#000;} .mp__thumb img{display:block;width:76px;height:92px;object-fit:cover;} .mp__info{max-width:400px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;padding:56px 0 40px;} .mp__title{font-family:var(--mp-serif);font-weight:200;font-size:48px;line-height:1.1;text-align:center;margin:0 0 24px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal;font-stretch:normal;} .mp__app{text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px;} .mp__price{font-family:var(--mp-serif);font-weight:200;font-size:24px;text-align:center;margin:24px 0 20px;} .mp__price s{opacity:.5;margin-left:8px;} .mp__color-label{font-family:var(--mp-serif);font-size:14px;color:#555;margin:0 0 10px;} .mp__swatches{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-bottom:28px;} .mp__swatch{display:block;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;padding:2px;border:1px solid #ddd;} .mp__swatch.is-current{border-color:#000;border-width:2px;padding:1px;} .mp__swatch img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;} .mp__swatch.is-soldout{position:relative;} .mp__swatch.is-soldout:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:50%;top:3px;bottom:3px;width:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.8);transform:rotate(45deg);} .mp__variant{width:100%;height:46px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:12px;padding:0 14px;margin-bottom:12px;font:inherit;} .mp__buy{display:flex;gap:10px;} .mp__qty{flex:0 0 126px;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;padding:0 6px;} .mp__qty button{background:none;border:0;font-size:20px;width:36px;height:40px;cursor:pointer;color:#000;} .mp__qty input{width:34px;border:0;text-align:center;font:inherit;font-size:14px;-moz-appearance:textfield;background:none;} .mp__qty input::-webkit-inner-spin-button{-webkit-appearance:none;} .mp__add{flex:1;height:52px;border:0;border-radius:18px;background:#b33a18;color:#fff;font-family:var(--mp-sans);font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;cursor:pointer;} .mp__add:disabled{background:#d89a8a;cursor:not-allowed;} .mp__stock{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:12px;margin:28px 0 0;} .mp__stock span{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#bbb;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #eee;} .mp__stock.is-in span{background:#3a9b5c;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #d8efe0;} .mp__delivery{font-size:15px;line-height:24px;margin:24px 0 0;padding-bottom:32px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;} .mp__trust{list-style:none;padding:24px 0 0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;} .mp__trust li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-size:13px;color:#444;} .mp__short{font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;margin:36px 0 20px;} .mp__acc{border:0;} .mp__acc summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:8px 0;} .mp__acc summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;} .mp__acc summary span{flex:1;} .mp__acc[open] .mp__chev{transform:rotate(180deg);} .mp__acc-body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;padding:8px 0 0 34px;} .mp__features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px;padding:96px 40px 40px;text-align:center;} .mp__features h2{font-family:var(--mp-serif);font-weight:400;font-size:24px;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 28px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal;font-stretch:normal;} .mp__features p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;} .mp__reco{padding:80px 40px 60px;} .mp__reco h2{font-family:var(--mp-serif);font-weight:200;font-size:24px;text-align:center;margin:0 0 40px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal;font-stretch:normal;} .mp__reco-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;} .mp__reco-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000;text-decoration:none;} .mp__reco-card img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;margin-bottom:24px;} @media (max-width:767px){ .mp__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .mp__slider{border-radius:0;} .mp__slide{flex-basis:90%;} .mp__arrow{display:none;} .mp__thumbs{display:none;} .mp__info{padding:28px 20px 32px;max-width:none;} .mp__title{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:18px;} .mp__features{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:48px;padding:48px 20px 20px;} .mp__reco{padding:48px 20px;} .mp__reco-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;} } </style><script> (function(){var root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling.previousElementSibling;if(!root||!root.classList.contains('mp')){root=document.querySelector('.mp');}var track=root.querySelector('[data-track]');var thumbs=root.querySelectorAll('[data-thumb]');function go(i){var s=track.children[i];if(s){track.scrollTo({left:s.offsetLeft,behavior:'smooth'});}}function cur(){return Math.round(track.scrollLeft/track.clientWidth);}var p=root.querySelector('[data-prev]');var n=root.querySelector('[data-next]');if(p){p.addEventListener('click',function(){go(Math.max(0,cur()-1));});}if(n){n.addEventListener('click',function(){go(Math.min(track.children.length-1,cur()+1));});}thumbs.forEach(function(t){t.addEventListener('click',function(){go(parseInt(t.getAttribute('data-thumb'),10));});});track.addEventListener('scroll',function(){var c=cur();thumbs.forEach(function(t,i){t.classList.toggle('is-active',i===c);});});root.querySelectorAll('[data-qty]').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){var inp=b.parentElement.querySelector('input');var v=parseInt(inp.value,10)||1;v=v+parseInt(b.getAttribute('data-qty'),10);inp.value=v<1?1:v;});});})(); </script> {% schema %} { "name": "Fiche produit", "settings": [ { "type": "text", "id": "trust_1", "label": "Réassurance 1", "default": "Paiement 100% sécurisé" }, { "type": "text", "id": "trust_2", "label": "Réassurance 2", "default": "Retours faciles sous 14 jours" }, { "type": "text", "id": "trust_3", "label": "Réassurance 3", "default": "Chaque pièce est préparée avec soin" }, { "type": "text", "id": "short_text", "label": "Phrase courte", "default": "Pièce artisanale, tressée à la main — aucun modèle identique." }, { "type": "range", "id": "delivery_days", "label": "Délai de livraison affiché (jours)", "min": 1, "max": 20, "step": 1, "default": 7 }, { "type": "text", "id": "f1_title", "label": "Colonne 1 - titre", "default": "Savoir-faire artisanal" }, { "type": "richtext", "id": "f1_text", "label": "Colonne 1 - texte", "default": "<p>Chaque pièce est façonnée à la main selon un savoir-faire artisanal.</p><p>Plus de 3 heures de travail est nécessaire pour donner vie à un seul sac, du premier tressage aux finitions.</p><p>De légères variations peuvent exister : elles témoignent simplement du caractère unique de chaque pièce.</p>" }, { "type": "text", "id": "f2_title", "label": "Colonne 2 - titre", "default": "Livraison gratuite" }, { "type": "richtext", "id": "f2_text", "label": "Colonne 2 - texte", "default": "<p>Livraison offerte dès 70€ d'achat.</p><p>Votre commande est préparée avec soin puis livrée sous 3 à 5 jours ouvrables.</p><p>Chaque pièce est vérifiée avant son départ afin de garantir une qualité irréprochable.</p>" }, { "type": "text", "id": "f3_title", "label": "Colonne 3 - titre", "default": "Une pièce qui dure" }, { "type": "richtext", "id": "f3_text", "label": "Colonne 3 - texte", "default": "<p>Pensée pour accompagner le quotidien.</p><p>Nos pièces sont conçues pour être portées, utilisées et conservées au fil des saisons.</p><p>Des matériaux sélectionnés avec exigence et une fabrication soignée pour une pièce qui traverse le temps.</p>" }, { "type": "text", "id": "reco_title", "label": "Titre suggestions", "default": "Vous aimerez peut-être aussi" }, { "type": "collection", "id": "reco_collection", "label": "Collection des suggestions" } ], "blocks": [ { "type": "@app" } ] } {% endschema %}